ASUS ALC256 headset microphone fix

Replacement Realtek modules for ASUS FX608LP laptops with ALC256 (10ec:0256)
and subsystem ID 1043:1064. The cold-boot initialization sequence has restored
headset microphone recording on the tested laptop.

Packages match one Fedora kernel version and preserve its original modules.
Installation signs the replacement modules when /etc/keys/modsign.key and
/etc/keys/modsign.der exist, then runs depmod. Secure Boot requires the signing
certificate to be trusted. Missing key files cause signing to be skipped.

If the target initramfs contains Realtek modules, rebuild it after installation
or removal and reboot. Removing this package restores the original module
selection for that kernel.

Project, releases and installation details:
https://github.com/fxzxmicah/ASUS-ALC256-10431064
